  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint2/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e: module-level import socket plus def g(): import mysock as socket still makes f's socket.socket(h) -> python:mysock:0-0:socket; _extract_imports (py.py:2683) still uses ast.walk. Residual 3 now reproduced live (was code-read only): (lambda os: os.environ)(1) emits module_attr_ref to python:os:0-0:os.environ. Residuals 2, 4, 5 not re-checked. MECHANISM: import maps built file-scoped by ast.walk over the whole tree; only some consumers narrowed by ScopeStack. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-dagig,WI-lijab."  # b96d
